.
.TH OMNotebook 1 "" "OpenModelica @OM_MANPAGE_VERSION@" "OpenModelica User Commands"
.
.\" --------------------------------------------------------------------
.SH NAME
.\" --------------------------------------------------------------------
.
OMNotebook \- interactive electronic notebook for Modelica
.
.\" --------------------------------------------------------------------
.SH SYNOPSIS
.\" --------------------------------------------------------------------
.
.B OMNotebook
.RI [ file ]
.
.\" --------------------------------------------------------------------
.SH DESCRIPTION
.\" --------------------------------------------------------------------
.
.B OMNotebook
edits and evaluates notebooks: documents that mix text, Modelica code and
OpenModelica scripting commands with their results, including plots. It is
used for teaching and experimentation, and ships with two tutoring systems
built from notebooks:
.TP
.B DrModelica
for teaching Modelica.
.TP
.B DrControl
for teaching control theory with Modelica.
.PP
.I file
is the notebook to open, an
.BR .onb ,
.B .onbz
or Mathematica
.B .nb
file. Without one,
.B OMNotebook
opens DrModelica.
.PP
It links the OpenModelica compiler in rather than starting
.BR omc .
The working directory is
.I OpenModelica
in the temporary directory, usually
.IR /tmp/OpenModelica ,
so that generated code and result files do not clutter the directory it was
started from.
.
.\" --------------------------------------------------------------------
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.\" --------------------------------------------------------------------
.
.TP
.B TMPDIR
The temporary directory the working directory is created in. The default is
.IR /tmp .
.
.\" --------------------------------------------------------------------
.SH FILES
.\" --------------------------------------------------------------------
.
.TP
.I /usr/share/omnotebook/drmodelica/DrModelica.onb
.TQ
.I /usr/share/omnotebook/drcontrol/
The DrModelica and DrControl notebooks, for an installation in
.IR /usr .
Other installations keep them under
.I share/omnotebook/
in their installation directory.
.
